  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions like create mindscape, except it can affect more creatures, the mindscape lasts longer, and you can choose the mindscape’s magic trait. You can also direct a number of believable creatures at a time equal to your caster level.\n\nGreater create mindscape can be made permanent with a permanency spell by a caster of 15th level or higher at a cost of 17,500 gp. You and other creatures aware of a permanent mindscape can come and go using the mindscape door spell.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell functions like create mindscape, except it can affect more creatures, the mindscape lasts longer, and you can choose the mindscape’s magic trait. you can also direct a number of believable creatures at a time equal to your caster level.\\n\\ngreater create mindscape can be made permanent with a permanency spell by a caster of 15th level or higher at a cost of 17,500 gp. you and other creatures aware of a permanent mindscape can come and go using the mindscape door spell.\"",
